sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Webhook as External Webhook / API Client
    participant API as agent_api.py (webhook / completion)
    participant Snapshot as CanvasReplicaService
    participant Engine as Graph Engine (agent/canvas.py)
    participant DB as MySQL DB (agent_session)

    Webhook->>API: POST /v1/agent/{id}/webhook
    API->>API: Security Signature & Auth Validation
    API->>Snapshot: Commit Runtime Replica Snapshot
    Snapshot->>DB: INSERT INTO canvas_replica
    API->>Engine: Graph(replica_dsl).run(input_payload)
    
    loop Component DAG Processing
        Engine->>Engine: Run component logic & emit SSE events
    end

    Engine-->>API: Execution Result Artifacts
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO agent_session (status='SUCCESS', outputs)
    API-->>Webhook: 200 OK Response Payload
